  "query_preview": "..\n(Monday through next Friday) \nIssued at 1019 AM CST Fri Nov 20 2026\n\nThe front will be clear of the area by midday Monday with \ntemperatures cooling behind the front. Highs next week will be in \nthe 50s and even some 40s. There will be another trough that will \ndig into the Gulf Tuesday into Wednesday which will bring another \nlow to medium chance of showers locally on Wednesday. In \naddition, it will bring a reinforcing shot of cold air. Right now,\nThanksgiving looks dry with lows around freezing and highs in the\n40s to around 50. Confidence in that forecast at this point is \nmedium as it will depend on the track and timing of the mid week \nsystem.",
